# ============================================================================
# .gitignore for the PUBLIC repo (github.com/paleomitchelljs/diets)
# Tracks: analysis code, curated/derived small data tables, figures, docs.
# Excludes: copyrighted source PDFs + specimen images, large third-party
# datasets (fetch separately; see data/external_data_wanted.md), and large
# regenerable pipeline outputs.
# ============================================================================

# --- macOS / R cruft ---
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
.Rhistory
.Rapp.history
.RData

# --- Source materials: EVERYTHING under pdfs/ (copyrighted journal PDFs, raw
#     data drops, digitized images) EXCEPT the INTAKE.md doc. Plus specimen images. ---
pdfs/
images/

# --- Large third-party datasets (redistribution-restricted / huge) ---
data/AVONET/
data/pantheria
data/mass_references/*.xls
data/mass_references/*.XLS
data/mass_references/*.xlsx

# --- Large regenerable structured tables (rebuild via code/x10,x13,x14,x16) ---
data/structured/fishbase.csv
data/structured/aviandietdb_dietdb.csv
data/structured/aviandiet_long.csv
data/structured/aviandiet_gut.csv
data/structured/raptor_diets_long.csv

# --- Derived / regenerable pipeline outputs ---
data/longform.csv
data/phylo_tree.rds
data/phylo_A.rds
data/phylo_model.stan
data/fit_simple.rds
data/fit_phylo.rds
data/*.log

# --- Historical archives (large; may include copyrighted material) ---
archive_owl/
archive_old_pipeline/

# ============================================================================
# Intentionally TRACKED (small, curated, reviewable, or the project's own work):
#   code/                                  full analysis pipeline x00-x16
#   data/raw_data.csv                      source diet matrix (project's compilation)
#   data/fossil_predprey.csv, fossil_diet_extractions.csv, extant_new_observations.csv
#   data/mass_overrides.csv, mass_gaps.csv, intake_manifest.csv
#   data/reconciliations.md, observation_bias_notes.md, external_data_wanted.md,
#     INTEGRATED_SOURCES.md
#   data/*_slopes*.csv, fossil_gut_points.csv, fossil_clade_resemblance.csv,
#     extant_gut_ppmr_by_clade.csv, clade_lines_gut_equiv.csv, mode_offset_by_clade.csv
#   data/structured/{tucker2016_mammal_ppmr,gator_jekyll_stomach,aviandiet_gut_ppmr,
#     raptor_diets_gut,fishbase_lw_coef}.csv
#   data/mass_references/theropoda_benson.csv   (dinosaur femur->mass calibration)
#   figures/                               project's own plots
#   pdfs/INTAKE.md, README.md, relaunch.md, .gitignore
# ============================================================================
